{"ex-3B07-1":{"id":"ex-3B07-1","chapter":"3B07","number":1,"title":"描述縱波","question":"<p>一列縱波向左傳播。下圖顯示縱波上的粒子在不同時刻 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的位置。求縱波的波幅、波長、週期、頻率和波速率。</p><p>a b c d e f g h i j 平衡位置a b cde f g h i j</p><p>t = 1 s a bcd e f g h i j</p><p>t = 2 s abc d e f g h i j</p><p>t = 3 s ab c d e f g hi j</p><p>t = 4 s a b c d e f ghi j</p><p>t = 5 s 5 cm 傳播方向</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/94bb4242f96f28b6b8225ac6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:467.2px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>粒子 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 2 s 時與平衡位置的距離最大。</p><p>∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 6 cm</p><p>在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 3 s，粒子 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是兩個相鄰的密部中心。</p><p>∴ λ = 8 × 5 = 40 cm = 0.4 m</p><p>粒子 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1 s 至 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 5 s 期間振動了半個週期。</p><p>∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 2 × (5 – 1) = 8 s</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>T</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{8}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.125 Hz</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span>λ = (0.125)(0.4) = 0.05 m s<sup>–1</sup></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B07_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"76fda273629a7c3509dddf9141ac0b6a6435155e7f7eeb0b7cf99b68e6c4ebf6","segments":[{"page":4,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,284.8939833984375,560.2833009033203,524.8820648193359],"text":"例 題 1 描述縱波\r\n一列縱波向左傳播。下圖顯示縱波上的粒子在不同時刻 t 的位置。求\r\n縱波的波幅、波長、週期、頻率和波速率。\r\na b c d e f g h i j\r\na b cde f g h i j\r\na bcd e f g h i j\r\nabc d e f g h i j\r\nab c d e f g hi j\r\na b c d e f ghi j\r\nt = 1 s\r\nt = 2 s\r\nt = 3 s\r\nt = 4 s\r\nt = 5 s\r\n平衡位置\r\n傳播方向 5 cm\r\n"},{"page":4,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,524.8820648193359,560.2833009033203,748.4189833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n粒子 a 在 t = 2 s 時與平衡位置的距離最大。\r\n∴ A = 6 cm\r\n在 t = 3 s，粒子 b 和 j 是兩個相鄰的密部中心。\r\n∴ λ = 8 × 5 = 40 cm = 0.4 m\r\n粒子 d 在 t = 1 s 至 t = 5 s 期間振動了半個週期。\r\n∴ T = 2 × (5 – 1) = 8 s\r\nf = 1\r\nT\r\n = 1\r\n8\r\n = 0.125 Hz\r\nv = fλ = (0.125)(0.4) = 0.05 m s–1\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B07-2":{"id":"ex-3B07-2","chapter":"3B07","number":2,"title":"縱波的頻率","question":"<p>一列縱波沿軟彈簧向右傳播。圖 a 顯示三幅軟彈簧的照片，拍攝的時距為 0.6 s。縱波的頻率可能是多少？試寫出數值最小的三個，並解釋答案。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/24888b455d6602908f9eb51e.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:291.7px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 至 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.6 s 期間，縱波傳播的距離可能是0.5λ、1.5λ（圖 b）、2.5λ 等。</p><p>如果縱波以 0.6 s 傳播 0.5λ，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{0.5λ}{0.6}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.833λ</p><p>如果縱波以 0.6 s 傳播 1.5λ，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1.5λ}{0.6}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 2.5λ 圖 b 如果縱波以 0.6 s 傳播 2.5λ，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2.5λ}{0.6}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 4.17λ</p><p>根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mi>λ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{v}{λ}</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.833 Hz</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 2.5 Hz</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 4.17 Hz </p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/d8261e02ef8343a3e6ab9b3b.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:295.7px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B07_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"76fda273629a7c3509dddf9141ac0b6a6435155e7f7eeb0b7cf99b68e6c4ebf6","segments":[{"page":5,"kind":"question","box":[54.83430090332031,236.90498339843748,565.1673009033203,395.68064880371094],"text":"例 題 2 縱波的頻率\r\n一列縱波沿軟彈簧向右傳播。圖 a 顯示三幅軟彈簧\r\n的照片，拍攝的時距為 0.6 s。縱波的頻率可能是\r\n多少？試寫出數值最小的三個，並解釋答案。\r\n"},{"page":5,"kind":"answer","box":[54.83430090332031,395.68064880371094,565.1673009033203,747.2689833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n在 t = 0 至 t = 0.6 s 期間，縱波傳播的距離可能是\r\n0.5λ、1.5λ（圖 b）、2.5λ 等。\r\n如果縱波以 0.6 s 傳播 0.5λ，\r\nv1 = 0.5λ\r\n0.6\r\n = 0.833λ\r\n如果縱波以 0.6 s 傳播 1.5λ，\r\nv2 = 1.5λ\r\n0.6\r\n = 2.5λ\r\n如果縱波以 0.6 s 傳播 2.5λ，\r\nv3 = 2.5λ\r\n0.6\r\n = 4.17λ\r\n根據 f = v\r\nλ\r\n，\r\nf1 = 0.833 Hz\r\nf2 = 2.5 Hz\r\nf3 = 4.17 Hz\r\n複雜7 Q6 (p.190)\r\nt = 0\r\nt = 0.6 s\r\nt = 1.2 s\r\n傳播方向\r\n圖 a\r\n圖 b\r\nt = 0\r\nt = 0.2 s\r\nt = 0.4 s\r\nt = 0.6 s\r\n1.5λ\r\n傳播方向\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B07-3":{"id":"ex-3B07-3","chapter":"3B07","number":3,"title":"粒子運動","question":"<p>一列縱波向左傳播。下圖顯示縱波上的粒子在時間 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的位置。</p><p>(a) 寫出一個與 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span> 振動同相的粒子。</p><p>(b) 寫出一個與 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span> 振動反相的粒子。</p><p>(c) 寫出一個在時間 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> 瞬時靜止的粒子。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/fa94914bdf564c16c0c5512e.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:531.0px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>c</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p>(b) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>l</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p>(c) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>i</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>g 和 c 的平衡位置相距 0.5λ，h 和 d 的平衡位置也一樣。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B07_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"76fda273629a7c3509dddf9141ac0b6a6435155e7f7eeb0b7cf99b68e6c4ebf6","segments":[{"page":6,"kind":"question","box":[183.4833009033203,388.3609833984375,560.4833009033202,602.2041625976562],"text":"例 題 3 粒子運動\r\n一列縱波向左傳播。下圖顯示縱波上的粒子在時間 t 的位置。\r\na b c d e f g h i j k l m 平衡位置\r\n傳播方向\r\n時間 t\r\n(a) 寫出一個與 k 振動同相的粒子。\r\n(b) 寫出一個與 h 振動反相的粒子。\r\n(c) 寫出一個在時間 t 瞬時靜止的粒子。\r\n"},{"page":6,"kind":"answer","box":[183.4833009033203,602.2041625976562,560.4833009033202,709.7409833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) c\r\n(b) d 或 l\r\n(c) a、e、i 或 m\r\n"},{"page":6,"kind":"tips","box":[40,384.3609833984375,179.4833009033203,709.7409833984375],"text":"提提你\r\ng 和 c 的平衡位置相距\r\n0.5λ，所 以 h 和 d 的平衡\r\n位置也相距0.5λ。\r\n注意\r\nc、g 和 k 在時間 t 正以最\r\n高速率移動，並非瞬時靜"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B07-4":{"id":"ex-3B07-4","chapter":"3B07","number":4,"title":"縱波的 s–t 線圖","question":"<p>一列縱波向右傳播，下圖顯示縱波上粒子 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span>–<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> 線圖。取向右的位移為正。</p><p>(a) 求縱波的振幅。</p><p>(b) 求縱波的頻率。</p><p>(c) 描述粒子 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 在以下時刻的運動。</p><p>(i) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0</p><p>(ii) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1 s</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/2620ca6c1d912461659ed0d2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:282.6px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 3 cm</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>T</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.25 Hz</p><p>(c) (i) 粒子 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 正在向右移動。</p><p>(ii) 粒子 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是瞬時靜止的。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>在 t = 0 剛過之後，s 由 0 變為正值，所以 P 沿正方向移動。留意題目所定義的正方向，不要回答「向上」。</p>","think":"<p>如果波向左傳播，並取向左的位移為正，(c) 的答案會如何改變？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>(i) 在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 時，所給位移–時間圖的斜率為正。取向左為正，因此 P 向左移動。(ii) 在 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 時，圖線斜率為零，因此 P 仍瞬間靜止。粒子的速度由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>s</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>–<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>t</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 圖的斜率及所選正方向決定，不能只憑波的傳播方向判斷。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B07_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"76fda273629a7c3509dddf9141ac0b6a6435155e7f7eeb0b7cf99b68e6c4ebf6","segments":[{"page":9,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,232.9759833984375,565.2833009033203,533.5634613037109],"text":"例 題 4 縱波的 s–t 線圖\r\n一列縱波向右傳播，下圖顯示縱波上粒子 P 的 s–t 線圖。取向右的位\r\n移為正。\r\n–3\r\n0\r\n3\r\n2 4 6\r\nt / s\r\ns / cm\r\n(a) 求縱波的振幅。\r\n(b) 求縱波的頻率。\r\n(c) 描述粒子 P 在以下時刻的運動。\r\n (i) t = 0\r\n (ii) t = 1 s\r\n"},{"page":9,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,533.5634613037109,565.2833009033203,672.1009833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 3 cm\r\n(b) f = 1\r\nT\r\n = 1\r\n4\r\n = 0.25 Hz\r\n(c) (i) 粒子 P 正在向右移動。\r\n (ii) 粒子 P 是瞬時靜止的。\r\n"},{"page":9,"kind":"tips","box":[40,228.9759833984375,184.2833009033203,672.1009833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n在 t = 0的下一刻，s 由0變\r\n成正數，因此粒子 P 向着正\r\n值方向移動。注意題目定義\r\n的正值方向，切勿以「P 正\r\n"},{"page":9,"kind":"answer","box":[185.28300480332032,661.5503844984376,568.2830048033203,750.4543844984375],"text":"想一想\r\n如果縱波向左傳播，並且取向左的位移為正，(c) 的答案會怎樣改\r\n變？\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","englishAlignedFields":["tips","think","thinkAnswer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B07-5":{"id":"ex-3B07-5","chapter":"3B07","number":5,"title":"縱波的 s–d 線圖","question":"<p>一列縱波向右傳播，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span> <sup>s</sup> <sup>/</sup> <sup>cm</sup> 傳播方向是縱波上的粒子。圖示縱波在時5 間 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 的 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span>–<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span> 線圖，線圖取向0 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>X</mi><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4812</mn><mi>Y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{X Z}{4 8 12 Y}</annotation></semantics></math></span> d / cm 右的位移為正。</p><p>(a) 求縱波的波長。 <sup>–5</sup></p><p>(b) 寫出在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 時處於密部中心的粒子。</p><p>(c) 描述在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 時粒子 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的運動。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/2e0251bdc40df8c17959b60b.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:266.2px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 8 cm</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>(c) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span> 正在向左移動。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>極短時間後的 s–d 圖：</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/a7ae42a250a6d6a263aca66b.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:182.5px\"></p><p>∴ Z 沿負方向移動，即向左移動。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B07_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"76fda273629a7c3509dddf9141ac0b6a6435155e7f7eeb0b7cf99b68e6c4ebf6","segments":[{"page":11,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,291.55998339843745,565.2833009033203,490.8756561279297],"text":"例 題 5 縱波的 s–d 線圖\r\n一列縱波向右傳播，X、Y 和 Z\r\n是縱波上的粒子。圖示縱波在時\r\n間 t = 0 的 s–d 線 圖，線 圖 取 向\r\n右的位移為正。\r\n(a) 求縱波的波長。\r\n(b) 寫出在 t = 0 時處於密部中心的粒子。\r\n(c) 描述在 t = 0 時粒子 Z 的運動。\r\n"},{"page":11,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,490.8756561279297,565.2833009033203,598.4129833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 8 cm\r\n(b) X\r\n(c) Z 正在向左移動。\r\n–5\r\n0\r\n5\r\n4 8 12\r\nX Z\r\nY\r\ns / cm\r\nd / cm\r\n傳播方向\r\n"},{"page":11,"kind":"tips","box":[40,287.55998339843745,184.2833009033203,598.4129833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n在一段短時間後的 s–d 線\r\n圖：\r\n0 d\r\ns\r\nZ\r\n一段短時間後\r\n∴ Z 正在向負值的方向移\r\n動，即向左移動。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B07-6":{"id":"ex-3B07-6","chapter":"3B07","number":6,"title":"量度聲音在空氣中的傳播速率","question":"<p>嘉儀做實驗測量聲音在空氣中的傳播速率。她把兩個微音器連接至一個計時器（圖 a），然後用錘子敲一下金屬板製造聲響。當 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 探測到敲擊聲，計時器開始計時，而 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 探測到敲擊聲時，計時器便停止。從計時器讀取時間 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> 以及量度 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 之間的距離 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span>，就可以找出聲音的傳播速率。</p><p>圖 a 圖 b</p><p>(a) 嘉儀應該在圖 b 中的 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點還是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點敲擊金屬板？</p><p>(b) 嘉儀以不同的距離 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span> 重複實驗，以下是她記錄的數據。</p><div class=\"study-table-wrap\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span> / m</p></td><td><p>0.4</p></td><td><p>0.5</p></td><td><p>0.6</p></td><td><p>0.7</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> / ms</p></td><td><p>0.82</p></td><td><p>1.47</p></td><td><p>1.75</p></td><td><p>2.05</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>根據數據估算聲音在空氣中的傳播速率。</p><p>(c) 試解釋為甚麼距離 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的值不能太小。</p><p>(d) 試解釋為甚麼金屬板不應該接觸桌面。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/80e01fff45ec5c2fc9c17db5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:542.3px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點</p><div class=\"study-table-wrap\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span> / m</p></td><td><p>0.4</p></td><td><p>0.5</p></td><td><p>0.6</p></td><td><p>0.7</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> / ms</p></td><td><p>0.82</p></td><td><p>1.47</p></td><td><p>1.75</p></td><td><p>2.05</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> / m s<sup>–1</sup></p></td><td><p>488</p></td><td><p>340</p></td><td><p>343</p></td><td><p>341</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>(b)</p><p>聲音的傳播速率 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>340</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>343</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>341</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{340 + 343 + 341}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 341 m s<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(c) 如果 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span> 太小，量度結果的百分誤差會很大。</p><p>(d) 如果金屬板接觸着桌面，部分聲波便會在桌子中傳播。由於聲波在桌子中的速率比在空氣中高得多，因此實驗結果會受影響。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>如果她在 Q 處發聲，聲音在時間 t 內傳播的距離便等於 QY – QX，而非 d。</p><p>提示</p><p>取多組數據的平均值，可平均每組數據的誤差。第一組數據與其他數據相差很大，因此不予採用。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B07_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"76fda273629a7c3509dddf9141ac0b6a6435155e7f7eeb0b7cf99b68e6c4ebf6","segments":[{"page":16,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,56.333983398437454,560.2833009033203,516.0454559326172],"text":"例 題 6 量度聲音在空氣中的傳播速率\r\n嘉儀做實驗測量聲音在空氣中的傳播速率。她把兩個微音器連接至一\r\n個計時器（圖 a），然後用錘子敲一下金屬板製造聲響。當 X 探測到敲\r\n擊聲，計時器開始計時，而 Y 探測到敲擊聲時，計時器便停止。從計\r\n時器讀取時間 t 以及量度 X 和 Y 之間的距離 d，就可以找出聲音的傳\r\n播速率。\r\n計時器\r\nX\r\nY\r\n微音器\r\n圖 a\r\nQ\r\nP\r\n000\r\nd\r\nX Y\r\n計時器\r\n開始 停止\r\n圖 b\r\n(a) 嘉儀應該在圖 b 中的 P 點還是 Q 點敲擊金屬板？\r\n(b) 嘉儀以不同的距離 d 重複實驗，以下是她記錄的數據。\r\nd / m 0.4 0.5 0.6 0.7\r\nt / ms 0.82 1.47 1.75 2.05\r\n根據數據估算聲音在空氣中的傳播速率。\r\n(c) 試解釋為甚麼距離 d 的值不能太小。\r\n(d) 試解釋為甚麼金屬板不應該接觸桌面。\r\n"},{"page":16,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,516.0454559326172,560.2833009033203,748.0149833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) P 點\r\n(b) d / m 0.4 0.5 0.6 0.7\r\nt / ms 0.82 1.47 1.75 2.05\r\nv / m s–1 488 340 343 341\r\n聲音的傳播速率 = 340 + 343 + 341\r\n3\r\n = 341 m s–1\r\n(c) 如果 d 太小，量度結果的百分誤差會很大。\r\n(d) 如果金屬板接觸着桌面，部分聲波便會在桌子中傳播。由於聲波\r\n在桌子中的速率比在空氣中高得多，因此實驗結果會受影響。\r\n"},{"page":16,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.333983398437454,179.2833009033203,748.0149833984375],"text":"影片\r\n 這影片示範的實驗展示怎\r\n樣量度聲音在空氣中的傳播\r\n速率。\r\n提提你\r\n如果嘉儀在 Q 點發出聲\r\n音，聲音在時間 t 傳播的距\r\n離就是 QY – QX 而不是 d。\r\n提提你\r\n取幾組數據的平均值可以把\r\n各組數據中的誤差互相抵\r\n消。\r\n第一組數據大幅偏離其他數\r\n據，所以略去不計。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B07-7":{"id":"ex-3B07-7","chapter":"3B07","number":7,"title":"回 聲","question":"<p>文軒和穎瑤站在平坦且垂直的懸崖前方 150 m 的位置，兩人相距 400 m。</p><p>在時間 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0 文軒大喊了一聲。聲音在空氣中的速率是 340 m s<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p>(a) 文軒在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 聽到回聲。求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(b) 穎瑤首先直接聽到文軒的叫喊聲，然後再聽到來自懸崖的回聲。</p><p>兩個聲音之間的時距是多少？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/967ed884f980f0498a27e258.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:222.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{d}{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>150</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>340</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{150 \\times  2}{340}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.882 s</p><p>(b) 文軒的叫聲沿兩條路徑傳播至穎瑤。</p><p>路徑 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的長度 = 2 × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>150</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>400</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{150^{2} + ( \\frac{400}{2} )^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 500 m</p><p>兩條路徑的差距 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 500 – 400 = 100 m</p><p>時距 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>D</mi><mi>v</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{D}{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mn>340</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{100}{340}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.294 s</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/1f8ce65b7bcee99a25de7245.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:253.6px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>聲音由 Steven 傳至峭壁，再反射回到他身邊。</p><p>∴ d = 150 × 2 = 300 m</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B07_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"76fda273629a7c3509dddf9141ac0b6a6435155e7f7eeb0b7cf99b68e6c4ebf6","segments":[{"page":18,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,56.333983398437454,560.2833009033203,243.6500701904297],"text":"例 題 7 回 聲\r\n文軒和穎瑤站在平坦且垂直的懸崖前\r\n方 150 m 的位置，兩人相距 400 m。\r\n在時間 t = 0 文軒大喊了一聲。聲音在\r\n空氣中的速率是 340 m s–1。\r\n(a) 文軒在 t = t1 聽到回聲。求 t1。\r\n(b) 穎瑤首先直接聽到文軒的叫喊聲，然後再聽到來自懸崖的回聲。\r\n兩個聲音之間的時距是多少？\r\n"},{"page":18,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,243.6500701904297,560.2833009033203,497.1839833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) t1 = d\r\nv\r\n = 150 × 2\r\n340\r\n = 0.882 s\r\n(b) 文軒的叫聲沿兩條路徑傳播至穎瑤。\r\n150 m\r\n文軒 400 m 穎瑤\r\n路徑 A\r\n路徑 B\r\n懸崖\r\n路徑 B 的長度 = 2 ×\r\n•\r\n1502 +\r\n• 400\r\n2\r\n•2\r\n = 500 m\r\n兩條路徑的差距 D = 500 – 400 = 100 m\r\n時距 = D\r\nv\r\n = 100\r\n340\r\n = 0.294 s\r\n150 m\r\n400 m\r\n文軒\r\n懸崖\r\n穎瑤\r\n"},{"page":18,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.333983398437454,179.2833009033203,497.1839833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n聲音從文軒的位置傳到懸\r\n崖，然後再反射回去。\r\n∴ d = 150 × 2 = 300 m\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B07-8":{"id":"ex-3B07-8","chapter":"3B07","number":8,"title":"聲音的干涉","question":"<p>在籃球場上，兩個揚聲器 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 連接到訊號產生器，發出同相而頻率為 850 Hz 的聲音。家明沿着 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span> 行走，然後在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點停下。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點與<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點相距 13.1 m，與 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點相距 12.1 m。已知聲音在空氣中的速率為340 m s<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p>(a) 求 850 Hz 聲音的波長。</p><p>(b) 解釋家明在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點聽到的是響亮聲音還是微弱聲音。</p><p>(c) 這個實驗在戶外進行比在實驗室裏進行有甚麼優勝之處？試舉出一項。</p><p>(d) 如果增加聲音的頻率，沿 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span> 聽到響亮聲音的兩個相鄰位置，它們之間的距離會有甚麼變化？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/31e83ee28d437c9cce1c1ba7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:313.5px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span>λ，</p><p>λ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mi>f</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{v}{f}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>340</mn><mn>850</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{340}{850}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.4 m</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的程差 = 13.1 m – 12.1 m = 1.0 m <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=</annotation></semantics></math></span> 2.5λ</p><p>∴ 在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點會發生相消干涉，即家明會聽到微弱聲音。</p><p>(c) 這樣可以減少自周圍環境反射的回聲。</p><p>(d) 如果聲音的頻率增加，波長便會減小。</p><p>因此，聽到響亮聲音的兩個相鄰位置會相距較近。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>腹線之間的距離隨波長減小而減小。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B07_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"76fda273629a7c3509dddf9141ac0b6a6435155e7f7eeb0b7cf99b68e6c4ebf6","segments":[{"page":22,"kind":"question","box":[183.4833009033203,149.1099833984374,560.4833009033202,542.6722564697266],"text":"例 題 8 聲音的干涉\r\n在籃球場上，兩個揚聲器 P 和 Q 連接到訊號產生器，發出同相而頻\r\n率為 850 Hz 的聲音。家明沿着 AB 行走，然後在 X 點停下。X 點與\r\nP 點相距 13.1 m，與 Q 點相距 12.1 m。已知聲音在空氣中的速率為\r\n340 m s–1。\r\nA B\r\nX\r\nP Q\r\n13.1 m 12.1 m\r\n訊號產生器\r\n(a) 求 850 Hz 聲音的波長。\r\n(b) 解釋家明在 X 點聽到的是響亮聲音還是微弱聲音。\r\n(c) 這個實驗在戶外進行比在實驗室裏進行有甚麼優勝之處？試舉出\r\n一項。\r\n(d) 如果增加聲音的頻率，沿 AB 聽到響亮聲音的兩個相鄰位置，它們\r\n之間的距離會有甚麼變化？\r\n"},{"page":22,"kind":"answer","box":[183.4833009033203,542.6722564697266,560.4833009033202,747.2089833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 根據 v = fλ，\r\nλ = v\r\nf\r\n = 340\r\n850\r\n = 0.4 m\r\n(b) X 點的程差 = 13.1 m – 12.1 m = 1.0 m = 2.5λ\r\n∴ 在 X 點會發生相消干涉，即家明會聽到微弱聲音。\r\n(c) 這樣可以減少自周圍環境反射的回聲。\r\n(d) 如果聲音的頻率增加，波長便會減小。\r\n因此，聽到響亮聲音的兩個相鄰位置會相距較近。\r\n"},{"page":22,"kind":"tips","box":[40,145.1099833984374,179.4833009033203,747.2089833984375],"text":"如果多人一同參與這實\r\n驗，便可找出節線和腹線\r\n的位置（所有人都站在出\r\n現響聲或弱聲的位置）。\r\n影片\r\n 這影片示範聲音干涉的實\r\n驗。實驗會顯示節線的位置。\r\n提提你\r\n波長愈短，腹線相距愈近。\r\n抗噪耳機\r\n抗噪耳機利用聲音的干\r\n涉來抵消噪音。\r\np.198\r\n知多一點\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3B07-9":{"id":"ex-3B07-9","chapter":"3B07","number":9,"title":"樂 音","question":"<p>下圖顯示樂音 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的波形。兩圖的時間軸及振幅軸的標度相同。</p><p>(a) 比較這兩個樂音的響度。</p><p>(b) 比較這兩個樂音的音調。</p><p>(c) 這兩個樂音是否有相同的音品？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/32a8af3d2ecb7a873c96216b.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:494.5px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 樂音 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 比 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 響亮。</p><p>(b) 樂音 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的音調比 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 高。</p><p>(c) 它們的音品不相同。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>(a) P 的振幅較大。</p><p>(b) P 的周期較短，因此頻率較高。</p><p>(c) 波形不同。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3B07_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"76fda273629a7c3509dddf9141ac0b6a6435155e7f7eeb0b7cf99b68e6c4ebf6","segments":[{"page":31,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,565.2833009033203,346.81614685058594],"text":"例 題 9 樂 音\r\n下圖顯示樂音 P 和 Q 的波形。兩圖的時間軸及振幅軸的標度相同。\r\nP Q\r\n(a) 比較這兩個樂音的響度。\r\n(b) 比較這兩個樂音的音調。\r\n(c) 這兩個樂音是否有相同的音品？\r\n"},{"page":31,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,346.81614685058594,565.2833009033203,454.3529833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 樂音 P 比 Q 響亮。\r\n(b) 樂音 P 的音調比 Q 高。\r\n(c) 它們的音品不相同。\r\n"},{"page":31,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.33398339843757,184.2833009033203,454.3529833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n(a) 樂音 P 的振幅較大。\r\n(b) 樂音 P 的週期較短，因\r\n此頻率較高。\r\n(c) 兩者波形不相同。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}